posts.body:
Appears to instantly explode the game if I'm using it with YEP_CoreEngine.
That section is it merely booting the scenes:
Code:
Yanfly.Core.SceneManager_run = SceneManager.run;
SceneManager.run = function(sceneClass) {
  Yanfly.Core.SceneManager_run.call(this, sceneClass);
  Yanfly.updateResolution();
  if (!Utils.isNwjs()) return;
  if (Utils.RPGMAKER_VERSION && Utils.RPGMAKER_VERSION >= "1.6.0") return;
  if (Yanfly.Param.OpenConsole) Yanfly.openConsole();
};
Specifically 1371 is the third line.
Any ideas? I was going to use this with extracted effekseeker anims so they could be larger but still use MV spritesheets.
Hm, nevermind, actually it seems that it doesn't like the fact that the script directly downloaded from pastebin has a 1.00 in the filename. That causes it to fail loading (due to the excess period presumably).

